      399.13,
      539.86,
      434.2
    ],
    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Section 6(2)(b) and Section 21(2)(b) of the Town and Country PlanningOrdinance (Chapter 269), I, Ranil Wickramasinghe, Minister of Policy Planning, Economic Affairs, Child, Youth andCultural Affairs do by this order :-",
